  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Katoto n Code, JSON Schemas, ao Template ni Policy aika a Kona ni Warekaki irouni Mesin a License-aki i aan te MIT License, ma tii ngkana e a taekinaki bwa e kaokoro. Ko Kariaiakaki ni Kabongania n am Website n Akea Kabooaki.",
