  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Bitii Kaotioti n Riai nakon te Makete n Licensing ae Kona ni Mwakuri, n Onimakinana riki nakon Web ae tii Uoua Ana Kaeti (Kauki/Kainaki).",
  "Copied ✓": "E a Katotongaki ✓",
