  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Katean ae Eti: Draft n Ukeuke aika Inaomata, Baaire ibukin Protocols, ao te Kataki ni Baaire ae Kauki.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "E Kaetaki te Default are e Karaoaki Ngkoa: Belgium (BE) Ngkai e Kaeti Nakon te Taetae ni Dutch n Onimakinana nakon te Taetae ni Buranti — Aomata Aika a Taetae n Flemish a Bubura Riki Iai (~60%) nakoia Aomata Aika a Taetae n Walloon French (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "E Kaetaki te Default are e Karaoaki Ngkoa: Kazakhstan (KZ) Ngkai e Kaeti Nakon te Taetae ni Kazakh n Onimakinana nakoni Russian, Ngkai Iai ana Rairai te Taetae ni Kazakh — Aekan Kaetaki are Titeboo ma Kaetakin Belgium Ngkoa.",
  "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
