  "Fifteen languages live in total: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Persian, Bengali, Hindi.": "Tebwina ma Nimaua Taetae Ake a Live ni Kabotau: Ingiriti, Taetae ni Tiaina ae Traditional, Taetae ni Tiaina ae Simplified, Nihonggo, Korea, Buranti, Tiaman, Tibaania, Boritiukiti, Ruteia, Arabic, Turkey, Persian, Bengali, Hindi.",
